{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At launch, Magical Massage will not be available in English. However, I\u2019ll monitor the number of wishlists and prioritize translating into the languages with the highest demand. Make sure to add the game to your wishlist to show your interest!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068000/extras/f3f612e96556d9437c01e66259d65d33.webp?t=1759198612\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong>Summary</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068000/extras/f3f612e96556d9437c01e66259d65d33.webp?t=1759198612\" width=32 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme Life-and-Death Massage! Magical Massage is a dark humor visual novel about curing the embarrassing ailments of magicians. </strong>Enjoy magician's look of agony and cure embarrassing ailments! From hemorrhoids that cause earthquakes to rhinitis that make huge explosion...nothing too fancy that you can't handle. However, if your skills fall short, these powerful, unclothed magicians may kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As story develops,\u00a0watch the seeds of pain bloom into flowers of scars before your eyes, revealing the unpleasant truth of the world through youthful flesh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068000/extras/f3f612e96556d9437c01e66259d65d33.webp?t=1759198612\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong>How to play</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068000/extras/f3f612e96556d9437c01e66259d65d33.webp?t=1759198612\" width=32 height=32 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Massage:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the appropriate massage spot and pressure based on the magicians' reactions. Reckless touching of sensitive parts will cost you heavily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068000/extras/646a530677246107c1f8f4bc6300f29e.poster.avif?t=1759198612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068000/extras/646a530677246107c1f8f4bc6300f29e.webm?t=1759198612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hypnotic Guidance</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond intelligently to the hypnotized magician's nonsensical ramblings. (\u201cI'm going to lead a human-to-fish revolution!\u201d)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068000/extras/8a1f8bdd7aa82fc174dbaaddc6b37849.poster.avif?t=1759198612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068000/extras/8a1f8bdd7aa82fc174dbaaddc6b37849.webm?t=1759198612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stock Management</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay up to date with current affairs, track market trends, and budget wisely to stock fragrance powder and essential oils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068000/extras/26142fc0bf0cda9babe556b98fec6bdd.avif?t=1759198612\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work Hard, Play Hard</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a walk in the neighborhood, work on self-improvement, or go on vacations. Limitless opportunities to bond with your (clothed) clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068000/extras/52907965cca976443ecb4047dec75968.poster.avif?t=1759198612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068000/extras/52907965cca976443ecb4047dec75968.webm?t=1759198612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068000?t=1759198612","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068000?t=1759198612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068000/f282430bb61bf89a9929435bf5f9fe755c85f875/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759198612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068000/f282430bb61bf89a9929435bf5f9fe755c85f875/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759198612","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>About DEMO</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The demo includes the first 10 weeks (roughly 25% of the game's content) and features 9 characters (50% of the total cast).</strong></h2></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At launch, Magical Massage will not be available in English. However, I\u2019ll monitor the number of wishlists and prioritize translating into the languages with the highest demand. Make sure to add the game to your wishlist to show your interest!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\